<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia cuts official interest rates.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia cuts official interest rates.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said on Wednesday that it would cut official interest rates by 0.5 percentage points to 6.0 percent.</p>
<p>Rates were last cut on November 6 when the official cash rate was brought down to 6.5 percent from 7.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
